        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Ancêtre présumé de nombreuses espèces de Pokémon tortues, il peuplait les mers chaudes du monde il y a environ 100 millions d’années.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Reputed to be the ancestor of most turtle Pokémon, it lived in warm seas approximately a hundred million years ago.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "多くの　かめポケモンの　先祖と いわれる。　約１億年前の 温かい　海に　棲んでいた。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il a été recréé à partir d’un fossile préhistorique. Il vivait autrefois dans la mer, mais avait su s’adapter pour chasser aussi sur la terre ferme.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It was restored from an ancient fossil. Tirtouga lived in the sea but came up onto the land to search for prey.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "古代の　化石から　復活。 海に　暮らしていたが　獲物を 探して　陸にも　あがっていた。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Son terrain de chasse s’étendait sur un très vaste territoire, de la terre ferme jusqu’à 1 000 m sous les mers.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Its hunting grounds encompassed a broad area, from the land to more than half a mile deep in the ocean.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "深さ　１０００メートルの 深海から　陸地まで　広い 範囲を　狩場に　していた。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il vivait dans la mer pendant l’ère préhistorique. Il lui arrive de s’aventurer sur la terre ferme pour chasser, bien qu’il ne puisse que ramper.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
